      "id": "blk_27af6748",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“竞渡会”一名源于今州人对“渡过鸣潮危机”的强烈信念与期盼。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
