        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6f3d711f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "原是第一次残象潮战争胜利后，夜归军内放松心情、培养战友默契举办的小范围赛事。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ff9660f2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "如今已成为今州全民参与的军民运动竞技活动，旨在鼓励民众强健体魄，增进军民情谊，共克时艰。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
